{"task_id": "Mbpp/57", "solution": "def find_Max_Num(digits):\n    # Convert digits to strings and sort in descending order based on custom comparison\n    str_digits = [str(d) for d in digits]\n    \n    # Custom sort: compare concatenated strings to determine optimal order\n    from functools import cmp_to_key\n    \n    def compare(x, y):\n        if x + y > y + x:\n            return -1\n        elif x + y < y + x:\n            return 1\n        else:\n            return 0\n    \n    str_digits.sort(key=cmp_to_key(compare))\n    return int(''.join(str_digits))"}
