{"task_id": "Mbpp/123", "solution": "def amicable_numbers_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Sum all amicable numbers from 1 to n. Two numbers are amicable if each equals the sum of proper divisors of the other.\"\"\"\n    def sum_of_proper_divisors(num):\n        if num <= 1:\n            return 0\n        divisor_sum = 1\n        for i in range(2, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                divisor_sum += i\n                if i != num // i:\n                    divisor_sum += num // i\n        return divisor_sum\n    \n    amicable_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_i = sum_of_proper_divisors(i)\n        if sum_i > i and sum_i <= n and sum_of_proper_divisors(sum_i) == i:\n            amicable_sum += i + sum_i\n    \n    return amicable_sum"}
