{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "def pancake_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sort array using pancake sort algorithm by repeatedly flipping subarrays.\"\"\"\n    def flip(arr, k):\n        return arr[:k+1][::-1] + arr[k+1:]\n    \n    def find_max_index(arr, n):\n        max_idx = 0\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            if arr[i] > arr[max_idx]:\n                max_idx = i\n        return max_idx\n    \n    n = len(arr)\n    for curr_size in range(n, 1, -1):\n        max_idx = find_max_index(arr, curr_size)\n        if max_idx != curr_size - 1:\n            if max_idx != 0:\n                arr = flip(arr, max_idx)\n            arr = flip(arr, curr_size - 1)\n    \n    return arr"}
