{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"Find max contiguous subarray sum in array repeated k times.\"\"\"\n    if k == 1:\n        max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n    \n    # Calculate prefix max, suffix max, and total sum\n    prefix_max = [0] * n\n    suffix_max = [0] * n\n    \n    prefix_max[0] = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        prefix_max[i] = max(prefix_max[i-1] + arr[i], prefix_max[i-1])\n    \n    suffix_max[n-1] = arr[n-1]\n    for i in range(n-2, -1, -1):\n        suffix_max[i] = max(suffix_max[i+1] + arr[i], suffix_max[i+1])\n    \n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    # Max subarray in single array\n    max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n    \n    result = max_so_far\n    \n    if total_sum > 0:\n        result = max(result, prefix_max[n-1] + suffix_max[0] + (k-2) * total_sum)\n    else:\n        result = max(result, prefix_max[n-1] + suffix_max[0])\n    \n    return result"}
