{"task_id": "Mbpp/306", "solution": "def max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, i, k):\n    # Find max sum of increasing subsequence ending at or before index i\n    dp = [0] * (i + 1)\n    dp[0] = arr[0]\n    \n    for j in range(1, i + 1):\n        dp[j] = arr[j]\n        for prev in range(j):\n            if arr[prev] < arr[j]:\n                dp[j] = max(dp[j], dp[prev] + arr[j])\n    \n    # Find the maximum sum from prefix that can be extended to include arr[k]\n    max_sum = 0\n    for j in range(i + 1):\n        if arr[j] < arr[k]:\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, dp[j])\n    \n    return max_sum + arr[k]"}
