{"task_id": "Mbpp/306", "solution": "def max_sum_increasing_subseq(arr, n, i, k):\n    # Find max sum of increasing subsequence from prefix until i, including element at k\n    if i >= k or k >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    # DP for max increasing subsequence sum up to each index\n    dp = [0] * n\n    dp[0] = arr[0]\n    \n    for idx in range(1, n):\n        dp[idx] = arr[idx]\n        for prev in range(idx):\n            if arr[prev] < arr[idx]:\n                dp[idx] = max(dp[idx], dp[prev] + arr[idx])\n    \n    # Find best subsequence ending at or before i that can extend to k\n    max_sum = 0\n    for end in range(i + 1):\n        if arr[end] < arr[k]:\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, dp[end] + arr[k])\n    \n    return max_sum"}
