{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Generate Perrin sequence: P(n) = P(n-2) + P(n-3) for n >= 3\n    # Starting values: P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2\n    perrin = [3, 0, 2]\n    \n    # Generate remaining Perrin numbers up to index n-1\n    for i in range(3, n):\n        perrin.append(perrin[i-2] + perrin[i-3])\n    \n    return sum(perrin[:n])"}
