{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # First three Perrin numbers\n    a, b, c = 3, 0, 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return a\n    elif n == 2:\n        return a + b\n    elif n == 3:\n        return a + b + c\n    \n    total = a + b + c\n    \n    # Generate remaining Perrin numbers and add to sum\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_perrin = a + b\n        total += next_perrin\n        a, b, c = b, c, next_perrin\n    \n    return total"}
