{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum(arr, n):\n    # Use Kadane's algorithm to find maximum contiguous subarray sum\n    max_so_far = arr[0]\n    max_ending_here = arr[0]\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n    \n    return max_so_far"}
