{"task_id": "Mbpp/721", "solution": "def maxAverageOfPath(matrix):\n    n = len(matrix)\n    \n    def dfs(i, j):\n        if i == n - 1 and j == n - 1:\n            return matrix[i][j], 1\n        \n        max_avg = float('-inf')\n        best_sum = 0\n        best_count = 0\n        \n        if i + 1 < n:\n            sum_down, count_down = dfs(i + 1, j)\n            avg_down = (matrix[i][j] + sum_down) / (1 + count_down)\n            if avg_down > max_avg:\n                max_avg = avg_down\n                best_sum = matrix[i][j] + sum_down\n                best_count = 1 + count_down\n        \n        if j + 1 < n:\n            sum_right, count_right = dfs(i, j + 1)\n            avg_right = (matrix[i][j] + sum_right) / (1 + count_right)\n            if avg_right > max_avg:\n                max_avg = avg_right\n                best_sum = matrix[i][j] + sum_right\n                best_count = 1 + count_right\n        \n        return best_sum, best_count\n    \n    total_sum, total_count = dfs(0, 0)\n    return total_sum / total_count"}
