{"task_id": "Mbpp/721", "solution": "def maxAverageOfPath(grid):\n    n = len(grid)\n    \n    # memo[i][j] = (max_sum, path_length) for reaching cell (i, j)\n    memo = {}\n    \n    def dfs(i, j):\n        if i == n - 1 and j == n - 1:\n            return (grid[i][j], 1)\n        \n        if (i, j) in memo:\n            return memo[(i, j)]\n        \n        max_avg = float('-inf')\n        best_sum = 0\n        best_length = 0\n        \n        # Try going right\n        if j + 1 < n:\n            right_sum, right_length = dfs(i, j + 1)\n            total_sum = grid[i][j] + right_sum\n            total_length = 1 + right_length\n            avg = total_sum / total_length\n            if avg > max_avg:\n                max_avg = avg\n                best_sum = total_sum\n                best_length = total_length\n        \n        # Try going down\n        if i + 1 < n:\n            down_sum, down_length = dfs(i + 1, j)\n            total_sum = grid[i][j] + down_sum\n            total_length = 1 + down_length\n            avg = total_sum / total_length\n            if avg > max_avg:\n                max_avg = avg\n                best_sum = total_sum\n                best_length = total_length\n        \n        memo[(i, j)] = (best_sum, best_length)\n        return memo[(i, j)]\n    \n    total_sum, path_length = dfs(0, 0)\n    return total_sum / path_length"}
