{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "def toggle_middle_bits(n):\n    \"\"\"Toggle all bits except the first and last bit of the number.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    \n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    msb_pos = n.bit_length() - 1\n    \n    # Create a mask with 1s in all middle positions\n    if msb_pos <= 1:\n        return n\n    \n    mask = ((1 << (msb_pos - 1)) - 1) << 1\n    \n    # Toggle the middle bits\n    return n ^ mask"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "def toggle_middle_bits(n):\n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    if n <= 2:\n        return n\n    \n    # Count number of bits in the number\n    bit_count = n.bit_length()\n    \n    # Create mask with middle bits set to 1\n    mask = ((1 << (bit_count - 2)) - 1) << 1\n    \n    # Toggle middle bits using XOR\n    return n ^ mask"}
