{"task_id": "Mbpp/781", "solution": "def count_divisors(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if the count of divisors of n is even.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(1, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            if i * i == n:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n    return count % 2 == 0"}
